{"version":1,"content":"<p>黎芷珊舊愛張達倫一向是圈中公認的「愛妻號」與模範爸爸。</p><p>為了給9歲兒子「勁秋雞」（Zachary）及繼女更優質的成長環境，太太陳鳳玲（Kimmy）去年毅然放棄香港會所管理層的高薪厚職，帶着子女移居澳洲；</p><p>而張達倫則獨自留守香港及北上內地拚搏賺錢</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T12:12:00.785231+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T12:01:53+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T12:05:20.456844+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T12:05:20.456844+00:00","content_hash":"8e3e62d26d7f567400640a59c52a9d94f21be1e47a80ff578679527cf4998c89","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}